# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0008478> (spondylometaphyseal dysplasia, Schmidt type)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Orphanet:93316") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0008478> "A spondylometaphyseal dysplasia caused by a variation in COL2A1 gene. It is characterized by short stature, myopia, small pelvis, progressive kypho-scoliosis, wrist deformity, severe genu valgum, short long bones, and severe metaphyseal dysplasia with moderate spinal changes and minimal changes in the hands and feet.")
