# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0008704> (short-limb skeletal dysplasia with severe combined immunodeficiency)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Orphanet:935") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0008704> "Short-limb skeletal dysplasia with severe combined immunodeficiency is an extremely rare type of SCID characterized by the classical signs of T-B- SCID (severe and recurrent infections, diarrhea, failure to thrive, absence of T and B lymphocytes), associated with skeletal anomalies like short stature, bowing of the long bones and metaphyseal abnormalities of variable degree of severity.")
